      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm having a nightmare with this excel macro for our monthly reconciliation. i keep hitting a run-time error '1004': application-defined or object-defined error. it's a really weird bug, it's like the code works fine one minute and then just breaks out of nowhere on this specific line:\n\nSub MonthlyRecon()\n    Dim ws As Worksheet\n    Set ws = ThisWorkbook.Sheets(\"Monthly_Report\")\n    ws.Range(\"A1:Z100\").Value = DataArray\n    ws.Columns(\"A:Z\").AutoFit\nEnd Sub\n\nthe DataArray is definitely populated and the sheet name is correct. it feels like there's some kind of bug lurking in the logic that i just can't pin down. can you help me figure out why this range assignment is failing?",
